    "InfraInfiniteLine[p,q] or InfraInfiniteLine[germ]", "TableText",
     ExpressionUUID->"15675056-8c74-44a7-8bfe-5e44caeb97d9"], Cell["\<\
Finite maximal shortest-path meaning and germ overload remain.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"cac6b862-fd8f-4d64-9d21-1ba2ef9f3bc6"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
