     "780785fa-48ad-455d-95b9-2a21b92b9eb3"], Cell["\<\
Existing regular family remains; no corner-polygon overload is added.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"b16c53ce-9efc-4650-afdd-e0513e481203"]}
